        "text": "Anyone with at least one live assignment sees a business switcher at the top of the sidebar. Choosing a business sets the cookie. The API honours it only for the person's own business or one they are assigned to at that moment; anything else is silently treated as their own business. The amber Technician access label under the business name shows when the switcher is in that mode. All assigned ( ) is a read only overview across every business the person can reach. Each business is queried with its own assignment's scope, so a broad grant in one business never widens what is shown for another."
